{
  "info": {
    "name": "Troski Backend — Full",
    "description": "Complete endpoint coverage for the Troski-Backend project as of the latest build.\n\nHOW POSTMAN HANDLES AUTH:\n- Cookies (accessToken / refreshToken) are signed httpOnly cookies set by the server on verify-signup-otp / verify-otp / admin login. Postman's built-in cookie jar will keep them in the same session, so subsequent requests authenticate automatically.\n- The Paystack webhook is NOT a Postman call — Paystack hits it directly. Use Paystack's webhook tester or curl with `x-paystack-signature` header for manual testing.\n\nFLOWS:\n  Passenger sign-up → login → request ride → confirm boarding\n     1. POST /auth/sign-up               { name, phoneNumber, email, pinCode }\n     2. POST /auth/verify-signup-otp     { phoneNumber, otpCode }     (cookies set)\n     3. POST /auth/upload-photo          (multipart; required onboarding)\n     4. POST /auth/request-otp           { phoneNumber }              (next login)\n     5. POST /auth/verify-otp            { phoneNumber, otpCode }\n     6. (top up wallet OR pay each ride via paystack)\n     7. POST /trip/search                { pickup, dropoff }\n     8. POST /trip/:id/request-seat      { pickup, dropoff, paymentMethod, mobileMoney? }\n     9. POST /trip/booking/confirm-boarding  { code: '<4-digit>' }\n\n  Driver onboarding → going online → accepting passengers\n     1. (passenger flow first, ending fully onboarded)\n     2. POST /driver-application         (apply with Ghana card + license + selfie)\n     3. Admin approves application\n     4. POST /driver/vehicle             (multipart: 4 docs)\n     5. Admin approves vehicle\n     6. POST /driver-location/online     { latitude, longitude, destination }\n     7. GET  /trip/incoming-requests     (poll OR via socket)\n     8. PATCH /trip/booking/:id/accept\n     9. (drive; GPS auto-end fires at 30m from passenger drop-off)\n\n  Admin setup (one-time)\n     CLI: node src/scripts/seedSuperAdmin.js <username> <email> <password>\n     Then POST /auth/admin/login.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "phoneNumber", "value": "0244000001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "pinCode", "value": "123456", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminUsername", "value": "superadmin", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "Password123!", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tripId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bookingId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "applicationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "vehicleId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "inviteId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "inviteToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "inviteEmail", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "topupReference", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth — User",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign Up",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/sign-up",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ama Mensah\",\n  \"username\": \"ama.mensah\",\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{phoneNumber}}\",\n  \"email\": \"ama@example.com\",\n  \"pinCode\": \"{{pinCode}}\",\n  \"gender\": \"female\",\n  \"dateOfBirth\": \"2000-01-15\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Required fields now include username (unique, 3-30 chars [a-z0-9._]), gender (male/female/other), and dateOfBirth (ISO, 18+). The frontend can collect these across multiple screens but must send them in ONE final POST. Creates an unverified user and sends an OTP. Rate-limited 3/10min per IP."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Sign-up OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-signup-otp",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{phoneNumber}}\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"REPLACE_WITH_OTP_FROM_SMS_OR_LOGS\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "On success: sets accessToken + refreshToken signed cookies; you're now logged in. Rate-limited 5/10min."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload Profile Photo (REQUIRED onboarding)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/upload-photo",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [{ "key": "profilePhoto", "type": "file", "src": [] }]
            },
            "description": "Mandatory — flips isOnboardingComplete=true. Required before any trip / driver-application endpoint will accept you. Multipart with field name 'profilePhoto'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Complete Profile (optional: DOB, gender, emergency contact)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/complete-profile",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"dateOfBirth\": \"2000-01-15\",\n  \"gender\": \"female\",\n  \"emergencyContact\": {\n    \"name\": \"Yaa Mensah\",\n    \"phoneNumber\": \"0244000099\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "description": "JSON only — no photo. All three fields are optional; send any subset. gender ∈ {male, female, other, prefer_not_to_say}. dateOfBirth must be 18+. Profile photo is handled exclusively by /auth/upload-photo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify PIN (in-app sensitive-action gate)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-pin",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"pinCode\": \"{{pinCode}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — Request OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/request-otp",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{phoneNumber}}\",\n  \"method\": \"sms\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Rate-limited 3/10min. Only verified accounts can receive a login OTP."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — Verify OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-otp",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{phoneNumber}}\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"REPLACE_WITH_OTP\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Logs in. Sets fresh cookies."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot PIN — Start (sends OTP to registered phone)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-pin/start",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{phoneNumber}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Unauthenticated. Sends OTP via SMS to the registered phone (or no-ops silently if no account is found, to avoid leaking which numbers are registered). Rate-limited 3/15min."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot PIN — Reset (verifies OTP, sets new PIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-pin/reset",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phoneNumber\": \"{{phoneNumber}}\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"REPLACE_WITH_OTP\",\n  \"newPinCode\": \"654321\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Unauthenticated. Verifies the OTP, sets the new PIN (bcrypt-hashed), kills ALL active sessions for the user (so any leaked token is invalidated), and sends a security notification. Rate-limited 5/15min."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth — Admin",
      "description": "Bootstrap the first super_admin via `node src/scripts/seedSuperAdmin.js <username> <email> <password>`. All further admins must be invited.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUsername}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Send Admin Invite (super_admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/invite",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newadmin@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Generates a one-time secure link (48h expiry) and emails it. Only super_admin can call."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Outstanding Invites",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/invite" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Invite (public)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/invite/verify?token={{inviteToken}}&email={{inviteEmail}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "admin", "invite", "verify"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "token", "value": "{{inviteToken}}" },
                { "key": "email", "value": "{{inviteEmail}}" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register with Invite (public)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/register-with-invite",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{inviteToken}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{inviteEmail}}\",\n  \"username\": \"newadmin\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongPass1!\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Revoke Invite",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/invite/{{inviteId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin Logout",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/logout" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Driver Application",
      "description": "A logged-in user applies to drive. Admin reviews. On approval the user gets the 'driver' role + a Driver profile, and the selfie replaces the user's profile photo.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Submit Application (multipart)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.application && body.application._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('applicationId', body.application._id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-application",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "licenseID", "value": "ABC-12345678-1234", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "ghanaCardNumber", "value": "GHA-123456789-1", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "city", "value": "Accra", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "ghanaCardImage", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "licenseImage", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "selfieImage", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Three required files: ghanaCardImage, licenseImage, selfieImage (selfie becomes the user's verified profile photo on approval)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Application Status",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-application/me" }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Applications (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-application/admin?status=pending",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "driver-application", "admin"],
              "query": [{ "key": "status", "value": "pending" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get One Application (admin)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-application/admin/{{applicationId}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Approve Application (admin)",
          "request": { "method": "PATCH", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-application/admin/{{applicationId}}/approve" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reject Application (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-application/admin/{{applicationId}}/reject",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rejectionReason\": \"Selfie is too dark, please resubmit.\"\n}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Driver — Profile & Vehicle",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "My Driver Profile",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver/current" }
        },
        {
          "name": "My Vehicle",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver/vehicle" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Vehicle (multipart)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.vehicle && body.vehicle._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('vehicleId', body.vehicle._id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver/vehicle",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "plateNumber", "value": "GT-1234-24", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "vehicleType", "value": "Sprinter", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "vehicleColor", "value": "Yellow", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "vehicleCapacity", "value": "14", "type": "text" },
                {
                  "key": "routePreferences",
                  "value": "[{\"from\":\"Madina\",\"to\":\"Tema Station\"}]",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "JSON-stringified array of {from,to} objects"
                },
                { "key": "vehicleImage", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "insuranceCertImage", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "vehicleRegDocImage", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "DVLARoadworthyImage", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Driver must be approved (have a Driver profile) first. Creates Vehicle with vehicleStatus='pending'."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Driver Location & Session",
      "description": "Driver session lifecycle. Going online creates a Trip with a destination and fetches the Google Directions polyline.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Go Online (create trip)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.trip && body.trip._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('tripId', body.trip._id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-location/online",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"latitude\": 5.6792,\n  \"longitude\": -0.1672,\n  \"destination\": {\n    \"latitude\": 5.6747,\n    \"longitude\": -0.0167,\n    \"name\": \"Tema Station\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Go Offline",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-location/offline" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Location (live GPS)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-location/update",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"latitude\": 5.6800,\n  \"longitude\": -0.1500,\n  \"heading\": 90,\n  \"speed\": 35\n}"
            },
            "description": "Triggers auto-end check: if within 30m of any onboard passenger's drop-off, that booking auto-settles."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Walk-on Boarded (+1 cash passenger)",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-location/walkon/add" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Walk-on Got Off (-1 cash passenger)",
          "request": { "method": "POST", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/driver-location/walkon/remove" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trip — Passenger",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Search Nearby Trips (no live position returned)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trip/search",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"pickup\": { \"latitude\": 5.6792, \"longitude\": -0.1672 },\n  \"dropoff\": {\n    \"latitude\": 5.6261,\n    \"longitude\": -0.1131,\n    \"name\": \"Spintex\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "description": "Returns matching trips with ETA + per-passenger fare + remaining seats — no driver pin (anti-freeloading)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Request Seat (WALLET payment)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.booking && body.booking._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('bookingId', body.booking._id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trip/{{tripId}}/request-seat",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"pickup\": { \"latitude\": 5.6792, \"longitude\": -0.1672 },\n  \"dropoff\": {\n    \"latitude\": 5.6261,\n    \"longitude\": -0.1131,\n    \"name\": \"Spintex\"\n  },\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"wallet\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Holds escrow from passenger.wallet.balance. Booking immediately becomes 'pending' and the driver sees it."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Request Seat (PAYSTACK payment)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trip/{{tripId}}/request-seat",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"pickup\": { \"latitude\": 5.6792, \"longitude\": -0.1672 },\n  \"dropoff\": {\n    \"latitude\": 5.6261,\n    \"longitude\": -0.1131,\n    \"name\": \"Spintex\"\n  },\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"paystack\",\n  \"mobileMoney\": {\n    \"phone\": \"0244000001\",\n    \"provider\": \"mtn\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "description": "Fires chargeMobileMoney against the passenger's MoMo. Booking sits in 'awaiting_payment' until the user authorizes on their phone and the webhook fires charge.success."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My Active Booking",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trip/my-booking" }
        },
