    {
      "name": "Paystack Webhook (reference only — NOT for Postman)",
      "description": "The Paystack webhook is NOT something you call from Postman in the normal sense. Paystack POSTs to /api/v1/wallet/paystack/webhook with a JSON body and an `x-paystack-signature` header (HMAC-SHA512 of the raw body using your secret key).\n\nTo test locally:\n1. Set your webhook URL in the Paystack dashboard to https://your-tunnel.ngrok-free.app/api/v1/wallet/paystack/webhook\n2. Use a tunneling service like ngrok to expose your local server.\n3. Trigger a test event from the Paystack dashboard or use the dashboard's 'Resend webhook' button.\n\nEvents we handle:\n  - charge.success    → credits wallet (top-up) OR confirms ride payment (booking awaiting_payment → pending)\n  - charge.failed     → marks Payment failed; cancels booking if applicable\n  - transfer.success  → marks WithdrawalRequest completed\n  - transfer.failed / transfer.reversed → refunds driver wallet, marks request rejected",
      "item": []
    }
